# Carde.io exports carry players' emails and real names (registrations,
# standings, pairings and match exports), and decklist caches carry first
# name + initial. They are runtime caches the server re-fetches from Carde —
# never commit them: this repo is public. Files committed before this rule
# are still tracked until they are removed with `git rm --cached`.
data/cardeio/**/*registrations*.json
data/cardeio/**/pairings-*.json
data/cardeio/**/standings-*.json
data/cardeio/**/matches-*.json
data/cardeio/**/event-*-decklists.json
